§ `s 185 -- the applicable deadline`

#ASSERT `days after acceptance for processing to the applicable deadline` FALSE EQUALS 35
#ASSERT `days after acceptance for processing to the applicable deadline` TRUE EQUALS 42

§ `ss 185EC, 185G -- the vote`

#ASSERT `the value of the creditor` `a car lender owed $20,000 on security worth $15,000, voting no` EQUALS 5000

#ASSERT `the outcome of the vote` `Jake's creditors as illustrated` EQUALS `the proposal is accepted`
#ASSERT `the outcome of the vote` `the same creditors with the buy-now-pay-later provider voting no` EQUALS `the proposal is not accepted`
#ASSERT `the outcome of the vote` `creditors none of whom replies` EQUALS `the proposal lapses`
#ASSERT `the outcome of the vote` `a vote carried only by the administrator's related company` EQUALS `the proposal is not accepted`
#ASSERT `the outcome of the vote` `a vote tied in value` EQUALS `the proposal is not accepted`
#ASSERT `the outcome of the vote` `a vote against which a secured creditor counts only its shortfall` EQUALS `the proposal is accepted`

§ `s 185H -- when the agreement is made`

#ASSERT `a debt agreement is made` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `a debt agreement is made` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT `a debt agreement is made` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE

§ `ss 185F, 185K -- what a creditor may do`

#ASSERT NOT `a creditor may take the action while the proposal is being processed` `enforce a remedy against his person or property` `an ordinary provable debt`
#ASSERT `a creditor may take the action while the proposal is being processed` `start legal proceedings` `an ordinary provable debt`
#ASSERT `a creditor may take the action while the proposal is being processed` `enforce a remedy against his person or property` `a liability under a maintenance agreement or maintenance order`

#ASSERT NOT `a creditor may take the action while the agreement is in force` `enforce a remedy against his person or property` `an ordinary provable debt`
#ASSERT NOT `a creditor may take the action while the agreement is in force` `start legal proceedings` `an ordinary provable debt`
#ASSERT `a creditor may take the action while the agreement is in force` `enforce a remedy against his person or property` `a liability under a maintenance agreement or maintenance order`
#ASSERT `a creditor may take the action while the agreement is in force` `enforce a remedy against his person or property` `a debt incurred after acceptance for processing was recorded`
#ASSERT NOT `a creditor may take the action while the agreement is in force` `retain or deduct money owing to him` `a liability under a maintenance agreement or maintenance order`

#ASSERT NOT `a creditor may present or proceed with a creditor's petition` TRUE

§ `s 185C(2)(d), (e) -- proportionate payment`

-- 36 x $690 = $24,840 and 60 x $690 = $41,400, against provable debts of $41,000, for a creditor owed $20,500.
#ASSERT `this creditor's share` 20500 41000 24840 EQUALS 12420
#ASSERT `this creditor's share` 20500 41000 41400 EQUALS 20500

